  "description": "*“I'll protect the secondary male lead.”*\n\nI was reincarnated into a book's world. After losing my family, I ended up sold to the secondary male lead's house! In the original story, Adrian, the secondary male lead, is abused, betrayed... Enduring endless suffering before dying pointlessly. \n\n*“Even if he's secondary, do they have to squeeze every last drop out of him?!”*\n\nNina becomes Adrian's first friend and resolves to change his fate. Strategy for winning over the fierce yet tender male lead, part one: Feed him. But did she twist the original story too much? \n\n *\"Don't talk like that. Like I'm reacting to nothing, like all this means nothing to you.\"*\n\nAdrian's feelings began to flow in an unexpected direction.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
